'''Goop''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Polymorph (Classic)|Polymorph]] from an unknown and destroyed planet and the planet [[Viscosia]].{{Refn|[[:File:Goop Bandai Card.png]]|group = Bandai|name = Bandai}}

==Appearance==
===Ben as Goop===
Being a 200-pound single-celled organism{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/3/38/AF_Mini_Bible.pdf Alien Force Series Mini Bible]|group = AF Mini Bible|name = bible 4}}{{Refn|[[:File:Goop Single-Celled Organism.PNG]]|group = DM}} that is neither liquid nor solid but a colloidal suspension,{{Refn|[[:File:Max Out Premiered Earlier Than Intended.PNG]]|group = DM}} Goop is a green gelatinous humanoid that can take any shape at will. Goop has bright green eyes and an [[Anti-Gravity Projector (Classic)|Anti-Gravity Projector]] that allows him to be mobile in [[Earth (Classic)|Earth]]'s gravity. His brain is spread throughout his body.{{Refn|group = DM|name = link}}

In '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', Goop wore the [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]]/[[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest.

In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Heroes United]]'', the black outlines around Goop's eyes were thicker.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Goop has a nose-like beak and an amoeba-like shape. His Anti-Gravity Projector has been redesigned and the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol is on the top of it.

===Albedo as Negative Goop===
In '''Alien Force''', [[Albedo|Negative]] Goop looked exactly like [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s Goop.

In '''Omniverse''', Negative Goop looks mostly the same as Ben's Goop except his body, eyes, and the [[Ultimatrix (Stabilizer)|Ultimatrix]] on his Anti-Gravity Projector are recolored red.

