Goop's entire body is comprised of green [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cytoplasm cytoplasm] that is very bouncy and elastic. This gives him a wide and gangly range of motion, able to stretch his limbs very far to extend his grab reach, as demonstrated by [[Ultimate Kevin]],<ref name="TEoME">''[[The Enemy of My Enemy]]''</ref> or the reach of his punches and kicks.<ref name="IaMBW1">''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 1]]''</ref><ref name="TUH">''[[The Ultimate Heist]]''</ref> It also allows him to absorb all manner of impacts, useful for blocking opponents' attacks<ref name="NotLN" /> or cushioning falling people.<ref name="HT">''[[Hero Time]]''</ref><ref name="TCFB">''[[The Creature From Beyond]]''</ref>

Goop has the power of shapeshifting, allowing him to stretch, bend, and deform himself into any shape with ease, ranging from a [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pseudopodia pseudopod]-protruding glob of goo to a stretchy, bouncing ball and everything in between.{{Refn|group = AF Mini Bible|name = bible 4}} He can use this to dodge attacks;<ref name="IaMBW1" /> increase mobility;<ref name="BoaF">''[[Birds of a Feather]]''</ref> wrap around enemies;<ref name="TBotE">''[[The Beginning of the End]]''</ref> slip underneath doors or through small spaces;<ref name="NIBaC">''[[...Nor Iron Bars a Cage]]''</ref> and return to his normal shape if he is ever deformed or separated.<ref name="BaDGtMS">''[[Blukic and Driba Go to Mr. Smoothy's]]''</ref> Using his shapeshifting, Goop can mimic the shape of simple objects well enough to fool opponents, provided they don't look too closely.{{Refn|group = AF Mini Bible|name = bible 4}} Goop can also produce multiple prehensile pseudopods from his body to grab multiple opponents.<ref name="TBotE" />

Goop can produce additional cytoplasm to regenerate,<ref name="TBotE" /> make himself bigger, or have a stronger kinetic impact.<ref name="BoaF" /> He can also change its density depending on his desire,{{Refn|[[:File:Nothing on Earth With Ship's Speed.PNG]]|group = DM}} and the density of Goop's cytoplasm can increase to the point of breaking a metal pipe by the sheer force of its impact.<ref name="VoVP2">''[[Vengeance of Vilgax: Part 2]]''</ref>

Due to being made of cytoplasm, Goop can hold objects<ref>''[[Ben Again]]''</ref> or individuals inside his body to protect them.<ref name="BoaF" /> He can also wrap himself around someone to bind them in place.<ref name="DR">''[[Darkstar Rising]]''</ref><ref name="VoVP2" />

Goop is able to generate and expel cytoplasm from any part of his body for use as offensive weaponry,{{Refn|group = Bandai|name = Bandai}} even as spit despite having no visible mouth.<ref name="AaB">''[[Above and Beyond]]''</ref><ref name="NotLN">''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]''</ref> The cytoplasm he generates can change properties to be very adhesive.<ref name="AaB" /> He can shoot it in continuous streams similar to a water hose<ref name="GCBC" /> or in blob-like projectiles.<ref name="AaB" />

Goop is capable of making himself acidic at will, or his projectiles.<ref name="GCBC">''[[Good Copy, Bad Copy]]''</ref> His acid is able to dissolve a large variety of materials.<ref>''[[In Charm's Way]]''</ref><ref name="Primus">''[[Primus (Episode)|Primus]]''</ref><ref name="NIBaC" /><ref>''[[Catch a Falling Star]]''</ref> If he needs to, Goop is also able to neutralize his own acid.<ref>[[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Tennyson]]</ref><ref name="NotLN" />

Goop possesses enhanced strength, as he could wrestle [[Prior Gahlil]], someone who could easily overpower an armored [[Osmosian]].<ref name="DR" /> He can also increase the impact power of his attacks by stretching himself backwards and using the recoil to boost his momentum.<ref name="IaMBW1" />

Due to his body's incredible elasticity, Goop is extremely resilient, and his brain being spread across his body makes it so that he feels no pain from most physical attacks. This allows him to survive lethal falls without a scratch<ref>''[[Simple]]''</ref> and be bisected numerous times.<ref name="TBotE" />

Goop's cytoplasm is hydrophobic, allowing him to survive underwater, as seen when he hid in the sewer to ambush [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]].<ref name="VoVP2" /> Goop can additionally survive being atomized across an entire planet's worth of water volume, such as he did with [[Piscciss]]. Moreover, he was able to generate enough additional goop to color all the planet's water green.<ref name="Deep">''[[Deep]]''</ref>

Goop can survive in intense heat, such as the environment of his home planet [[Viscosia]].{{Refn|Goop Plumber Database; [[:File:Goop Plumber Database Collage.png|file]]|group = AF VG|name = PD}}

Goop can pass under an enemy's foot in order to make them slip.<ref>''[[Fool's Gold]]''</ref><ref name="TBotE" />

Goop can move his eyes all throughout his body.{{Refn|[[:File:Goop Movable Eyes.PNG]]|group = DJW}} He can also merge his eyes into one.<ref name="UC" />

===Equipment===
Goop's Anti-Gravity Projector allows him to be fully mobile on foreign planets like [[Earth (Classic)|Earth]] by generating a corrective field of gravity around him. It also enhances his shapeshifting capabilities, such as assisting in reconstituting himself. If Goop loses his Anti-Gravity Projector, the Omnitrix/Ultimatrix can immediately generate a new one.{{Refn|''link unavailable''|group = DM}}

Thanks to his Anti-Gravity Projector, Goop is capable of high-speed flight and levitation, being able to easily evade [[Trombipulor]]'s shots.<ref name="BaDGtMS" />

Goop's Anti-Gravity Projector has enough strength to pull continental-like masses of cytoplasm together, such as the cytoplasm-infected waters of Piscciss.<ref name="Deep" />

Goop can control and launch his Anti-Gravity Projector at enemies to attack them due to the edges of it being razor-sharp.<ref name="VoVP2" />

==Weaknesses==
<gallery type="slideshow">
IaMBW1 (148).png|Vulnerable Anti-Gravity Projector
IaMBW1 (152).png|Deactivated Anti-Gravity Projector
TPG (56).png|Compound Separation
UPdC (524).png|Boiling Point Limit
</gallery>
{{Quote|"What did you do? I can't move!"<br>"I know, I turned off Goop's artificial gravity"|Vilgax (as Goop) and Ben. <ref>''[[Primus (Episode)|Primus]]''</ref>}}
Goop is limited to his [[Anti-Gravity Projector (Classic)|Anti-Gravity Projector]] controlling his body, making it a vulnerable target for opponents. Goop's opponents can take advantage of this weakness in various ways, such as grabbing it to forcefully pull Goop back<ref name="VoVP2" /> or shooting it with a [[Positron Blaster]], which causes Goop to spin rapidly and explode into multiple parts.<ref name="IaMBW1" /> Additionally, the Anti-Gravity Projector can also simply be switched off.<ref name="Primus" />

If Goop's Anti-Gravity Projector is separated from him or deactivated, Goop's body collapses into a puddle,<ref name="Primus" /><ref name="IaMBW1" /> only capable of slowly slithering around<ref name="TPG">''[[The Perfect Girlfriend]]''</ref> until it is reactivated or he recollects it.<ref name="AaB" /><ref name="TPG" />

Despite being able to survive being atomized, Goop will start to hurt if he is, at the very least, spun very quickly in a centrifuge and beginning to separate into his constituent compounds.<ref name="TPG" /> Similarly, Goop would be destroyed on a molecular level should he be teleported due to being a single-celled organism.<ref>''[[Malgax Attacks]]''</ref>

Goop is vulnerable to being super heated and vaporized by an [[Ultimate Galvan]]'s energy beams.<ref>''[[A Fistful of Brains]]''</ref>

Goop is vulnerable to being hypnotized.{{Refn|[[:File:Polymorphs Can Be Hypnotized.png]]|group = DJW}}

Goop can be affected by a [[Nemuina]]'s sleeping dust.{{Refn|[[:File:Pesky Dust Can Affect Galvanic Mechamorphs and Polymorphs.PNG]]|group = DJW}}

==History==
===Alien Force=== 
*Goop first appeared in ''[[The Gauntlet]]'', where he defeated a [[Techadon Robot]].
*In ''[[Darkstar Rising]]'', Goop defeated [[Prior Gahlil]].
*In ''[[Good Copy, Bad Copy]]'', [[Albedo|Negative]] Goop hid from [[Alien Force|the team]] in a computer store and scared many customers away in the process. Later, [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] as Goop battled Negative [[Humungousaur (Classic)|Humungousaur]] before switching into [[Swampfire]].
*In ''[[Undercover]]'', Goop saved [[Cooper (Classic)|Cooper]] from some [[DNAlien]]s.
*In ''[[Birds of a Feather]]'', Goop helped [[Simian]] escape from some guards.
*In ''[[Vengeance of Vilgax: Part 2]]'', Goop escaped from the Omnitrix and hid in the sewers. He fought Swampfire before getting reabsorbed by him.
**The same scene reoccurred on TV in ''[[Fame]]''.
*In ''[[Don't Fear the Repo]]'', Goop fought the [[Vreedle Brothers]].
* In ''[[Simple]]'', Goop was used to avoid getting hurt after being pushed off a cliff.
*In ''[[Fool's Gold]]'', Goop defeated [[Mr. Coleman]].
*In ''[[Singlehanded]]'', [[Diamondhead (Classic)|Diamondhead]] turned into Goop to save himself from a bridge collapse while [[Julie Yamamoto|Julie]] was using his hand as a weapon, disgusting her.
*In ''[[In Charm's Way]]'', Goop battled a [[Rock Monster]] until it was sucked into a [[Magic (Classic)|magic]] vortex.
*In ''[[Primus (Episode)|Primus]]'', Ben turned [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]] into Goop and pulled the Omnitrix off his chest, removing the Omnitrix from Vilgax.{{Refn|group = note|[[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was able to easily remove the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] from [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]] while the latter was Goop because the device wasn't bonded to him and not due to any possible inherent weakness with Goop's body composition.{{Refn|[[:File:Omnitrix Bonded With Ben.png]]|group = DM}}}}
*In ''[[Above and Beyond]]'', Goop battled [[Pierce Wheels|Pierce]].

===Ultimate Alien=== 
*In ''[[Andreas' Fault]]'', Goop broke out of a dungeon cell and knocked out a [[Forever Knights|Forever Knight]] guard.
*In ''[[Hero Time]]'', Goop saved [[Julie Yamamoto|Julie]] from falling and battled [[Captain Nemesis|Overlord]] before turning into [[Waterhazard]] even though the chosen alien was [[Big Chill (Classic)|Big Chill]].
*In ''[[Deep]]'', Goop failed to escape some fans until [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] and [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] rescued him. Later, Goop used his Anti-Gravity Projector to save [[Piscciss]]. Although Goop was atomized and spread throughout Piscciss' sea, he was able to pull Piscciss back together.
* In ''[[...Nor Iron Bars a Cage]]'', Goop escaped a prison cell and unlocked the door to let Gwen out.
*In ''[[Viktor: The Spoils]]'', Goop briefly appeared as [[King Xarion]] was looking through the Ultimatrix for [[Ampfibian (Classic)|Ampfibian]].
*In ''[[Revenge of the Swarm]]'', Goop fought a [[Dr. Victor Valadis]] clone until it escaped into a sewer and left a [[Microchip]] behind, which Goop discovered.
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'', Goop battled some of [[Eon]]'s [[Eon's Minions|minions]].
*In ''[[The Creature From Beyond]]'', Goop saved Gwen and Kevin from falling to their deaths.
*In ''[[Greetings From Techadon]]'', Goop fought a [[Techadon Robot]].
*In ''[[The Perfect Girlfriend]]'', Goop was trapped and tortured by [[Ssserpent]] until "[[Elena Valadis|Julie]]" saved him.
*In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Ben 10/Generator Rex: Heroes United]]'', Goop appeared as one of the many aliens when Ben was explaining his story to [[Rex Salazar (Generator Rex)|Rex]].
* In ''[[Catch a Falling Star]]'', Goop broke into [[Captain Nemesis]] and [[Jennifer Nocturne]]'s [[Desert Dew Motor Court Hotel|motel]] room.
* In ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]'', Goop battled [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]] before switching into [[Ultimate Spidermonkey]] in a dream.
*In ''[[The Beginning of the End]]'', Goop defeated a group of Forever Knights on the [[Rustbucket 3]].

===Omniverse=== 
*In ''[[Blukic and Driba Go to Mr. Smoothy's]]'', Goop battled [[Trombipulor]] and saved [[Blukic]] and [[Driba]] from being devoured by him before switching into [[Echo Echo]].
*In ''[[Ben Again]]'', Goop was used by 11-year-old [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] in 16-year-old Ben's body to find a clue in a sink pipe.
*In ''[[The Ultimate Heist]]'', [[Albedo|Negative]] Goop was defeated by [[Terraspin]] while trying to retrieve the [[Polymorphic Crystal]].
*In ''[[A Fistful of Brains]]'', Goop was defeated by [[Ultimate Albedo]].
*In ''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 1]]'', Goop defeated [[Exo-Skull|Exo-Skull]], but was destabilized by [[Subdora]]. Fortunately, though, Goop's remains unintentionally created a means to track them down.
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', Goop appeared for a short time when Ben was cycling through his aliens.

