==Trivia== 
* Goop is one of the five aliens who escaped from the [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]]; the others are [[Way Big (Classic)|Way Big]], [[Ghostfreak]], [[Chromastone (Classic)|Chromastone]], and [[Spidermonkey (Classic)|Spidermonkey]].
* [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] believes Goop's high-pitched voice prevents others from taking him seriously.<ref name="TBotE" />
* The source of Goop's voice has changed throughout his appearances: 
**In ''[[The Gauntlet]]'', his voice came from his [[Anti-Gravity Projector (Classic)|Anti-Gravity Projector]].
**In his subsequent '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' appearances and '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', it came from himself.
** In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', it comes from his Anti-Gravity Projector again.
*When Goop spoke in ''[[Blukic and Driba Go to Mr. Smoothy's]]'', a crackle of static was heard at the end of each line as if he was speaking through a walkie-talkie.
*Unlike other aliens, during nighttime scenes, Goop's eyes are shaded.
*In the Portuguese and Arabic dubs, in certain episodes like ''[[Darkstar Rising]]'', Goop does not conventionally shout his name, he just shouts random grunts.
*Goop's Anti-Gravity Projector isn't part of his [[Polymorph (Classic)|Polymorph]] biology; he just has one due to the difference of gravity between [[Viscosia]] and [[Earth (Classic)|Earth]].{{Refn|[[:File:Kevin's Original Car.PNG]]|group = DM|name = link}} The projector is created using the same mechanism in which nanomachines break down Ben's clothing during his transformations.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben's Clothes During Transformations.PNG]]|group = DM}}
**Goop's Anti-Gravity Projector became a substitute for the missing Anti-Gravity Multiplier on the planet of [[Piscciss]].<ref name="Deep" />
**It was [[Derrick J. Wyatt]]'s idea to put Goop's [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol on his Anti-Gravity Projector in '''Omniverse'''. In his first drawing, the Omnitrix symbol was supposed to be floating inside Goop.{{Refn|[[:File:Goop OV Omnitrix Symbol Placement.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*During the pre-production stage of '''Alien Force''', Goop had concept art drawn by [[Eric Canete]].{{Refn|[[:File:Eric Canete Designed Goop Concepts.png]]|group = EC}}
*Goop was originally supposed to appear in:
**''[[Inside Man]]'' to corrode the [[Oscillator Key]], referred to as a Non-Dimensional Oscillator.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/2/24/Inside_Man_Script_Outline.pdf/revision/latest ''A Man Inside'' Script Outline]|group = outline}}
**''[[It's Not Easy Being Gwen]]'' to fight [[Dr. Animo (Classic)|Dr. Animo]]'s [[Mutant Frog]]s during [[Emily]]'s piano recital.{{Refn|https://archive.is/YKoW6|group = JHK}}
*Goop was originally supposed to appear a second time in ''[[Viktor: The Spoils]]'' to free [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] and [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] from their shackles.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/5/53/VTS_Script_Final_Draft.pdf ''Viktor: The Spoils'' Script Final Draft]|group = script|name = final}}
*Goop was originally not supposed to appear in the dream in ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]'', with [[Eatle]] taking his role.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/d/d4/Night_of_the_Living_Nightmare_Script_First_Draft.pdf ''Night of the Living Nightmare'' Script First Draft]|group = script|name = first}}
*Derrick believed that each alternate counterpart of Goop has a different color and flavor: 
**Ben Prime's Goop is green, and kiwi-flavored.{{Refn|[[:File:Goop Flavors.png]]|name=flavor|group=DJW}}
**[[Albedo|Negative]] Goop is red, and cherry-flavored.{{Refn|name=flavor|group=DJW}}
**[[Muck Amuck]] is blue, and blue-raspberry-flavored.{{Refn|[[:File:Muck Amuck Reveal.png]]|group = DJW}}
**[[Bad Ben]] as Goop is an unknown color, and licorice-flavored.{{Refn|[[:File:Alternate Goop Flavors.png]]|name=alt|group = DJW}}
**[[Mad Ben|Mad Ben]] as Goop is orange, and sour orange-flavored.{{Refn|name=alt|group = DJW}}
**[[Nega Ben]] as Goop is grey, and black pepper-flavored.{{Refn|name=alt|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Nega Ben Pepper.png]]|group=DJW}}
**[[Benzarro]] as Goop is purple, and grape-flavored.{{Refn|name=alt|group = DJW}}
**[[Argitrix]] Timeline [[Argit (Argitrix Timeline)|Argit]] as Goop is peach, and peach-flavored.{{Refn|[[:File:Argit's Goop.png]]|group = DJW}}
**[[Gwen 10 (Gweniverse)|Gwen 10]] as Goop is pink, and strawberry-flavored{{Refn|[[:File:Gwen 10 Goop.PNG]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:Gwen 10 Goop Flavor.PNG]]|group = DJW}} or watermelon-flavored.{{Refn|name=flavor|group=DJW}}

